brd-template, AskUserQuestion, template selection, custom template, SAFE BRD, legacy Inscore, DOCX conversion, documents skill, template type detection, example document, AI-powered, semantic analysis, instance-specific values, categories, project_name, person_name, date, metric, company, requirement_id, budget, role, semantic placeholders, user capacity, product owner, release date, response time target, context-aware, unconventional formats, MyApp, Q1 2026, Dr. Sarah Smith, 10,000 users, 500ms, TLS 1.3 kept literal, text length sorting, conversion quality, minimum 5 placeholders, template structure, sections array, subsections, hierarchy, ID format, PRE_XXX, TemplateStructure, totalSections, placeholders list
